{"title": "Dark Justiciar Helmet", "pageid": 10380, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet", "categories": ["Helmets", "Very rare items", "Discoverable Dark Justiciar set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Icon.png/300px-Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/1/13/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dark Justiciar Helmet image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Icon.png/300px-Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Dark Justiciar Helmet</span></a> is a very rare <a href=\"/wiki/Headwear\" title=\"Headwear\">Helmet</a> that improves the wearer's <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">Spells</a> and makes Critical Hits more likely while the wearer is obscured by darkness.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Adorned in a fanned coronet of speartip points, its mask fixed with stiff-lipped intent, this helmet evokes a frightful, almost alien aspect that gestures to <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a>. For she is strange and terrible indeed.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" title=\"Helmets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/38px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/50px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helmets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Required Proficiency: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" title=\"Medium Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1 kg (2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1 kg (2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1600 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1600  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_DarkJusticiar_Helmet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_DarkJusticiar_Helmet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_DarkJusticiar_Helmet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">3523b640-e9da-4d89-b031-6ffe1d5fd3ed</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3523b640-e9da-4d89-b031-6ffe1d5fd3ed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3523b640-e9da-4d89-b031-6ffe1d5fd3ed\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_DarkJusticiar_Helmet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_DarkJusticiar_Helmet+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_DarkJusticiar_Helmet+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> +1</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Durability_(%2B1)\" title=\"Magical Durability (+1)\">Magical Durability</a></dt><dd>The wielder has a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a> against spells.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Covert_Critical\" title=\"Covert Critical\">Covert Critical</a></dt><dd>While <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obscured\">obscured</a>, the number you need to roll a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking is reduced by 1. This effect can stack.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-822&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-753</span>: inside a Gilded Chest behind the altar and beyond the riddle door in the <a href=\"/wiki/Silent_Library\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Silent Library\">Silent Library</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance in game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_ingame.png/450px-Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/c/c7/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_ingame.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Appearance in game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_ingame.png/450px-Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance in game</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dark_Justiciar_Set_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Full set in game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Dark_Justiciar_Set_ingame.png/450px-Dark_Justiciar_Set_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Dark_Justiciar_Set_ingame.png/675px-Dark_Justiciar_Set_ingame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/72/Dark_Justiciar_Set_ingame.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Full set in game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Dark_Justiciar_Set_ingame.png/450px-Dark_Justiciar_Set_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Dark_Justiciar_Set_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Cra